<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch AND soars on second day's trading.</title>
<headline>Dutch AND soars on second day's trading.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch AND International Publishers were up over forty percent on their second day of listing on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange, reaching a high of 5.90 guilders before pausing around 5.75, a 43.75 percent rise since the opening.</p>
<p>AND was the only gainer among the ten heaviest traded shares in Amsterdam by 12.55 GMT, ranking third in volume.</p>
<p>AND, listed on the London Alternative Investment Market (AIM) since July, started trading in Amsterdam at 3.30 guilders on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
